      {
        "fragment_id": "F002596",
        "review_id": "F70-0722",
        "assigned_sentiment": "positive",
        "fragment_sentiment": "positive",
        "text": "i also love that the wing mirrors fold in when the ignition is off",
        "text_truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "model": "F70",
          "country": "GB",
          "engine_type": "ICE"
        }
      },
      {
        "fragment_id": "F002188",
        "review_id": "F70-0598",
        "assigned_sentiment": "negative",
        "fragment_sentiment": "negative",
        "text": "the indicator stalk is plastic and makes an unpleasant click, and if you don't dim the interior lights by the wing mirrors at night they reflect very brightly in the mirrors",
        "text_truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "model": "F70",
          "country": "GB",
          "engine_type": "ICE"
        }
      },
      {
        "fragment_id": "F004968",
        "review_id": "F70-1383",
        "assigned_sentiment": "undetermined",
        "fragment_sentiment": "undetermined",
        "text": "on my last new 1 series the wing mirrors folded automatically,",
        "text_truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "model": "F70",
          "country": "GB",
          "engine_type": "ICE"
        }
      },
      {
        "fragment_id": "F005359",
        "review_id": "F70-1502",
        "assigned_sentiment": "negative",
        "fragment_sentiment": "negative",
        "text": "i have to turn the dash ambient lighting right down because it reflects off the door glass into the mirror, so when you glance at the mirror you mainly see the lights, which is really distracting",
        "text_truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "model": "F70",
          "country": "GB",
          "engine_type": "ICE"
        }
      },
      {
        "fragment_id": "F005781",
        "review_id": "F70-1612",
        "assigned_sentiment": "negative",
        "fragment_sentiment": "negative",
        "text": "my main concern is what i feel is a design fault in the interior lighting: the side pods at each corner of the dash reflect into the wing mirrors at night and really cut down what you can see",
        "text_truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "model": "F70",
          "country": "GB",
          "engine_type": "ICE"
        }
      },
      {
        "fragment_id": "F005427",
